  {
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 8.88,
   "text": "Some weeks, everything feels too loud. Find a therapist who speaks your language and gets what you are going through."
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.96,
   "t1": 14.8,
   "text": "Pick a time that works for you."
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.0,
   "t1": 27.14,
   "text": "Your first session, just 99 rupees. That first step is the hardest and you have taken it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.14,
   "t1": 30.42,
   "text": "Eunoia, find your way back to yourself."
  }
